  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support the Government of Armenia in applying the ratified ILO instruments particularly in the areas of freedom of association and collective bargaining and enhancing the country&#x2019;s legislative framework and practical application of international labour standards (ILS). The ILO will assist Armenia in assessment of national laws, preparing for ratification of conventions through legal analyses and sharing of comparative legislation and practices. The capacities of the tripartite constituents will be strengthened to ensure effective application of the ILS, and translation of the normative commitments into measurable progress towards stability and social justice including in the context of the refugee crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
